{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":24,"count":30,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L10-2-01\",\"咳嗽\",\"咳嗽/咳\",\"咳嗽/咳\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我咳嗽、頭痛，鼻子也不舒服。","pinyin":"Wǒ késou, tóu tòng, bízi yě bù shūfu.","english":"I have a cough and headache. Also my nose is uncomfortable.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-2-01","sourceFront":"咳嗽/咳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"咳(cough) + 嗽(cough) → both mean cough: 咳嗽 is to cough."},{"key":"[\"B2L01-1-22\",\"开玩笑\",\"開玩笑\",\"开玩笑\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"李先生喜歡開玩笑，是一個很有趣的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-1-22","sourceFront":"開玩笑","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他只是開個小玩笑而已，你何必那麼在乎呢？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-06","sourceFront":"何必","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L01-2-05\",\"危险\",\"危險\",\"危险\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"走路的時候看手機是很危險的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L01-2-05","sourceFront":"危險","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這條公路很危險，一下大雨，山上的石頭就會掉下來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-17","sourceFront":"下來","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我妹妹剛學會游泳，就想游到水很深的地方，我覺得太危險了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-12","sourceFront":"深","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個地區是個危險地帶，因為經常一下雨就有石頭掉下來，有時候連路都會塌了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-06","sourceFront":"地帶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小周才三十歲，就去過四十幾個國家，甚至去過一些又危險又刺激的地方，真是太酷了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-29","sourceFront":"酷","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個路口很危險，經常發生車禍。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-15","sourceFront":"車禍","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"危險物品必須放在小朋友伸手拿不到的地方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-18","sourceFront":"伸手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爬山時如果碰到大雨就應避免繼續前進，以免發生危險。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-20","sourceFront":"前進","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"碰到危險時，人的心跳總跳得很快。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-17","sourceFront":"心跳","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"軍人接到任務時，不管多麼危險都得努力完成。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-30","sourceFront":"接到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"開車時千萬別把頭探出車窗外，以免發生危險。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-02","sourceFront":"探","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"中國古代的人們相信，當好人碰到危險或困難時，會有神仙到人間來幫助他們。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-08","sourceFront":"神仙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L04-2-10\",\"了解\",\"了解/瞭解\",\"了解\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他想多了解一點兒台灣文化，所以決定來台灣留學。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-10","sourceFront":"了解","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"旅行的目的除了看風景，還可以了解那個地方的文化特色。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-12","sourceFront":"特色","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個民族都有自己特殊的風俗習慣，有時候外國人不容易了解。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-17","sourceFront":"風俗","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"出國學習語言可以了解外國的文化，再說，也可以認識外國朋友，非常值得。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-26","sourceFront":"再說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"背包客為了解省交通費，經常搭別人的車到下一個地點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-01","sourceFront":"背包客","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那對情侶因為不了解而在一起，沒想到最後因為了解而分開。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-36","sourceFront":"分開","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"就我對小林的了解，他是一個很實在的人，不但做事認真，說話也不誇張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-09","sourceFront":"就","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"青少年常因為不了解而誤會父母的教育方式，或許等他們長大了，就能真正明白了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-24","sourceFront":"真正","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果你想了解臺灣社會的人、事、物，最好親自來臺灣住一段時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-09","sourceFront":"社會","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經理找你談話，只是單純地想了解你對新工作適不適應，你別緊張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-13","sourceFront":"單純","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"出國當交換學生的目的，不僅僅是為了學習語言，更重要的是了解當地的文化。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-28","sourceFront":"僅僅","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"與人溝通時，最重要的是讓對方清楚了解你想表達的意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-04","sourceFront":"與","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"簡老闆因為生意的關係，經常接觸越南人，相當了解兩國之間工作習慣的差異。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-12","sourceFront":"接觸","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"明天的會議資料我已經上傳到雲端，請各位開會前先了解要討論的內容。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-23","sourceFront":"上傳","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"史教授為了讓更多人了解保護地球環境有多重要，經常到各地去演講。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-32","sourceFront":"演講","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個美國人每天看臺灣的連續劇，一方面學習中文，一方面了解臺灣的生活文化。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-26","sourceFront":"一方面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張老師認真觀察學生們的表現，這樣才能了解他們的心理和學習情況。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-23","sourceFront":"觀察","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小張喜歡閱讀法國的文學作品，透過這些作品，讓他了解了法國文化的特色。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-15","sourceFront":"文學","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經過服務人員詳細地說明，使得客人對公司的產品更了解了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-13","sourceFront":"使得","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有人說，想了解一個人的真心，就得看他做的事、他說的話。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-14","sourceFront":"真心","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不管做任何事都應先了解情況，省得白花精神。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-20","sourceFront":"省得","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"送禮品給外國朋友前，最好先了解不同國家的送禮習慣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-21","sourceFront":"禮品","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要是你對文藝領域不了解，最好不要隨便批評別人的作品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-01","sourceFront":"文藝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些國家機場對攜帶物品的規定很嚴，出國前最好了解清楚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-25","sourceFront":"嚴","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他來臺灣主要是想了解當地風俗，此外也想學習一點兒華語。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-13","sourceFront":"此外","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不要僅根據表面來判斷一個人或一件事，得花時間深入瞭解。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-14","sourceFront":"判斷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"天天說自己外行、不願嘗試的人，就無法更深入地瞭解世界。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-08","sourceFront":"外行","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老師提醒學生有疑問要馬上解決，免得越到後面越不了解。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-16","sourceFront":"疑問","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這件事我根本不了解，所以沒辦法給你適當的建議。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-20","sourceFront":"根本","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"世界各地的神話雖然不見得都真實，卻能讓人們多少了解一些古代的風俗習慣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-01","sourceFront":"神話","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人人都崇拜明星，但有多少人了解成功背後所付出的一切？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-29","sourceFront":"崇拜","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L04-2-28\",\"咸酥鸡\",\"鹹酥雞\",\"咸酥鸡\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L07-1-29\",\"位子\",\"位子\",\"位子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"搭火車的時候，我喜歡坐在窗戶旁邊的位子，邊聽音樂邊看風景。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-29","sourceFront":"位子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"搭公車時，年輕人應該把位子給老人坐，這是一種禮貌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-12","sourceFront":"禮貌","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在公車上，看到年紀大的人應該讓位子請他們坐。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-16","sourceFront":"讓","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-1-11\",\"滿\",\"滿\",\"满\",\"Vp/Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那個杯子裡裝滿了水。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-11","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"在這家餐廳吃飯，只要滿兩千塊，就送一盤水果。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-11","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那家印尼餐廳常常客滿，你最好先打電話訂位。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-23","sourceFront":"訂位","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那家餐廳的菜又便宜又好吃，所以假日常常客滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"