ourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"照華人的傳統習慣，女人生完孩子就要坐月子，一直在家休息到孩子滿月。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-01","sourceFront":"坐月子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:這個玩具雖然可愛，但是不適合送給剛滿月的孩子，我們還是送紅包吧！ B:也好。送紅包也不錯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-43","sourceFront":"也好","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在這家餐廳吃飯，要是滿兩千元，老闆就免費招待一盤炒青菜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-41","sourceFront":"招待","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小溫規劃的旅遊行程，有參觀、購物、看表演等活動，我相信大家會很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-04","sourceFront":"行程","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小溫規劃的旅遊行程，有參觀、購物、看表演等活動，我相信大家會很滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-04","sourceFront":"歌仔戲","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母要經常陪孩子聊天、玩遊戲，給零用錢不能完全滿足孩子的需要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-25","sourceFront":"需要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家餐廳的菜不僅平價，還很營養，常常中午十二點前舉客滿了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-11","sourceFront":"平價","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老闆收到一封寫滿越南文的信，辦公室沒人看得懂，非找人翻譯不可。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-18","sourceFront":"非","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"黃先生上班常遲到，也不認真工作，這樣的態度讓老闆很不滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-21","sourceFront":"不滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一些家長對現在的升學制度不滿，認為學校不應該逼孩子寫那麼多測驗題目。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-28","sourceFront":"制度","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"張經理今天的工作行程安排得很滿，連吃飯、休息的時間都沒有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-14","sourceFront":"滿","sou